"# Exhaustive Forensic UX & DOM Audit: Wonderbly UAE Storefront & Personalization Funnel\n\n> **Date of Audit**: September 2026  \n> **Market Target**: United Arab Emirates (`/ae`)  \n> **Store URL Audited**: `https://www.wonderbly.com/ae`  \n> **Flagship Bestseller Audited**: *The Little Boy/Girl Who Lost Their Name* (`/ae/personalized-products/lost-my-name-v2-book`)  \n> **Secondary Bestseller Audited (Avatar Builder)**: *Where Are You?* (`/ae/personalized-products/where-are-you-book`)  \n> **Target Benchmark**: To replicate, modernize, and decisively exceed on **PersonalizedTales.com**.\n\n---\n\n## Table of Contents\n1. [Executive Summary & High-Level Architecture](#1-executive-summary--high-level-architecture)\n2. [Forensic PDP Audit (Product Detail Page)](#2-forensic-pdp-audit-product-detail-page)\n   - 2.1 Hero Gallery & Media Carousel\n   - 2.2 Above-the-Fold Buy Box & Personalization Trigger\n   - 2.3 Pricing Display & Currency Behavior (AED vs USD)\n   - 2.4 Trust Badges & Social Proof Hierarchy\n   - 2.5 Key Product Specifications Block\n   - 2.6 Collapsible Accordions (Radix UI / Astro Islands)\n   - 2.7 Editorial Content, Author Story & Cross-Sell Rails\n   - 2.8 Trustpilot Reviews & UGC Photo Reviews Breakdown\n   - 2.9 Sticky Mobile Bottom Bar\n3. [Personalization Funnel Step-by-Step Teardown](#3-personalization-funnel-step-by-step-teardown)\n   - 3.1 Step 1: Character & Name Configuration (`/create/start`)\n   - 3.2 Detailed Avatar Builder Analysis (*Where Are You?*)\n   - 3.3 Step 2: Live Preview Reader Engine (`/create/preview`)\n   - 3.4 In-Reader Customization Drawers & Micro-Upsells\n   - 3.5 Step 3: Format Selection & Price Anchoring (`/create/formats`)\n   - 3.6 Step 4: Gift Box & Wrap Upsells (`/create/giftwraps`)\n   - 3.7 Step 5: Post-Add Interstitial (`/continue-shopping/kids`) & Cart (`/cart`)\n   - 3.8 Step 6: Checkout (`/checkout`) & UAE Delivery Signals\n4. [Exact DOM Selectors & CSS Architecture Matrix](#4-exact-dom-selectors--css-architecture-matrix)\n5. [The \"10X Playbook\" for PersonalizedTales.com](#5-the-10x-playbook-for-personalizedtalescom)\n   - Where Wonderbly Excels\n   - Wonderbly's Critical Weaknesses in the UAE & GCC Market\n   - Technical & UX Roadmap to Outperform Wonderbly\n\n---\n\n## 1. Executive Summary & High-Level Architecture\n\nWonderbly's frontend runs a hybrid architecture:\n- **Core Marketing & PDP Pages**: Powered by **Astro** with hydrated **Radix UI** components (Astro Islands: `<astro-island component-export=\"Accordion\">`), hosted on AWS CloudFront edge nodes.\n- **Creation, Live Preview & Checkout Funnels**: Built with **Next.js** using CSS Modules (`*.module.css`) and dynamic server-driven schemas.\n- **Dynamic Image & Spread Rendering Engine**: Served via a dedicated high-throughput image generation microservice on **`https://mu2.wonderbly.com`**, which compiles text overlays, child avatars, hair/skin swatches, and cover colorways on-the-fly into WebP/JPEG formats at specified pixel dimensions (`_width=1200`, `_q=0.8`).\n- **Currency & Billing**: Despite accessing from the UAE with `/ae` pathing, **all billing and prices are denominated in USD** (e.g. `$24.99 USD`, `$39.99 USD`). There is **no native AED currency display or Tabby/Tamara BNPL integration**, creating an immediate conversion friction point for Emirati and GCC customers.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Forensic PDP Audit (Product Detail Page)\n\n### 2.1 Hero Gallery & Media Carousel\n\n| Attribute | Specification |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| **DOM Container** | `nav[aria-label=\"Carousel primary navigation\"]` / `.Carousel-root-*` |\n| **Slide Count** | 7 active high-resolution slides |\n| **Slide Sequence** | 1. Flat lay book cover with title typography & character art<br>2. Open book double spread showing interior illustration<br>3. Two books side-by-side (different cover colors & softcover vs hardcover)<br>4. Custom name letter spread reveal<br>5. 4 cover colorway options fanned out<br>6. Emotional lifestyle photo (child reading on bed with parent)<br>7. Full-bleed whimsical story illustration collage |\n| **Image Hosting** | Prismic CMS CDN (`https://images.prismic.io/wonderbly/...`) with `auto=compress,format&w=1160` |\n| **Aspect Ratio** | Landscape 1.38:1 (`aspect-ratio: 1.38667 / 1`), matches physical A4 landscape format |\n| **Navigation Controls** | Accessible chevron buttons: `button \"Previous slide\"`, `button \"Next slide\"`, plus 7 round thumbnail dots at bottom |\n\n### 2.2 Above-the-Fold Buy Box & Personalization Trigger\n\nUnlike older landing pages that embedded inline textboxes directly on the PDP, Wonderbly currently utilizes a streamlined **\"Personalize my book\"** CTA gateway that transitions customers smoothly into a dedicated, distraction-free creation funnel:\n\n```html\n<form id=\"pdp-details-form\" class=\"Details-form astro-e2pjwumm\" method=\"get\" \n      action=\"/ae/personalized-products/lost-my-name-v2-book/create/start\" data-cta=\"form\">\n  \n  <!-- Language Selector Dropdown -->\n  <select class=\"Select-root-5ef8e\" name=\"locale\" data-testid=\"pdp-locale-select\">\n    <option value=\"en-US\">English (US)</option>\n    <option value=\"en-GB\">English (UK)</option>\n    <option value=\"fr\">French</option>\n    <option value=\"es\">Spanish</option>\n    <option value=\"it\">Italian</option>\n    <option value=\"nl\">Dutch</option>\n    <option value=\"de\">German</option>\n    <option value=\"pt-PT\">Portuguese (EU)</option>\n    <option value=\"da\">Danish</option>\n    <option value=\"sv\">Swedish</option>\n  </select>\n\n  <!-- Primary CTA Button -->\n  <button class=\"Button-Button-ae419 Button-Button--wide-ae419\" type=\"submit\" \n          data-personalise-button=\"true\" data-testid=\"pdp-cta\" data-gtm-id=\"pdp-cta\">\n    <span class=\"Button-Button-text-ae419\">Personalize my book</span>\n  </button>\n  \n  <!-- PayPal Pay Later Message -->\n  <div class=\"PayPalMessage astro-qba5djhb\" data-testid=\"pdp-paypal-message\">\n    <div id=\"pp-pay-later-message\">...</div>\n  </div>\n</form>\n```\n\n### 2.3 Pricing Display & Currency Behavior (AED vs USD)\n- **Selector**: `div.Price-price-18ed5[data-test-id=\"price-label\"]`.\n- **Rendered Output**: `<p><s class=\"Price-label-18ed5\">From </s>$24.99 USD</p>`.\n- **Attributes**: `data-test-price=\"$24.99 USD\"`, `pricelabel=\"From \"`, `amount=\"24.99\"`.\n- **Critical Finding for UAE**: Despite browsing from Dubai/Abu Dhabi on `/ae`, prices are locked to USD (`$24.99 USD`). Wonderbly relies on the user's credit card company or PayPal to do the FX conversion, which incurs a 3-5% bank FX fee for UAE shoppers.\n\n### 2.4 Trust Badges & Social Proof Hierarchy\n1. **Eyebrow / Kicker Badge**:\n   - Selector: `.TieredMessaging-eyebrow`\n   - Copy: `\"THE STORY FAMILIES KEEP COMING BACK TO, YEAR AFTER YEAR\"`\n2. **Social Impact Bar**:\n   - Direct inline proof: `\"$1 per copy sold goes to Save the Children.\"`\n3. **Trustpilot Sidebar Micro-Widget**:\n   - Template ID: `577258fb31f02306e4e3aaf9`\n   - Score: **4.8 out of 5 stars**\n   - Book-specific Review Count: **1,750 reviews** for SKU `lost-my-name-v2,lmn`\n   - Anchor Link: `a[href=\"#trustpilot-widget-1\"]` with copy `\"Read reviews\"`\n\n### 2.5 Key Product Specifications Block\nLocated directly above the price and CTA button, Wonderbly renders an icon-backed checklist:\n- 🎁 **Recommended for ages**: `0-8` (Icon: `/assets/icons/iconsax/gift.svg`)\n- 📖 **Preview pages before buying**: `Preview all 22 pages before buying` (Icon: `/assets/icons/iconsax/book-1.svg`)\n- 🌍 **Production & Shipping speed**: `Printed and dispatched in 2-4 working days` (Icon: `/assets/icons/iconsax/global.svg`)\n- ❤️ **Personalization depth**: `Upload a special photo` (Icon: `/assets/icons/iconsax/heart.svg`)\n\n### 2.6 Collapsible Accordions (Radix UI / Astro Islands)\nRendered within an Astro island (`<astro-island component-url=\"/_astro/Accordion.*.js\">`) using headless Radix primitives:\n\n1. **Accordion 1: \"How is the book personalized?\"**\n   - `Add a child’s first name, and see each letter become a character in their book.`\n   - `Choose a child’s adventurer`\n   - `Add your own free dedication to the first page`\n   - `Try it for yourself – preview the whole book before you buy!`\n2. **Accordion 2: \"What’s the story?\"**\n   - `A child must go on a quest to find their missing name. Along the way, they help a cast of curious characters who each hold a clue – revealing the child's name at the end!`\n3. **Accordion 3: \"Size & quality\"**\n   - `Each book is A4-sized (11.7\" x 8.3\"), making it ideal for bedtime stories and shared reading sessions. Printed on thick, quality paper and available in softcover or hardcover.`\n\n### 2.7 Editorial Content, Author Story & Cross-Sell Rails\n- **Hero Customer Endorsement**:\n  - Quote: *\"The gift recipient (and her parents) loved it as much as I did, and it quickly became a favorite in their house. Since then, I keep finding reasons to come back to buy more books!\"* — Judi\n- **Lifestyle Parent Proof**:\n  - Quote: *“Perfect gift for little ones! I often order it for when my friends have babies as I feel it’s nice to have something personalized and something that they can keep for when they’re older.”* — Lucy (with high-res mother/infant reading photography).\n- **Brand Origin & Author Credibility**:\n  - Heading 3: *\"The start of something Wonderbly\"* (Origin story in 2013).\n  - Heading 3: *\"Meet David\"* (Author bio: David Cadji-Newby, humanizing the book creation).\n  - Heading 3: *\"Discover the much-loved collection\"* (Linking to sequels: *Found My Friends*, *Dared To Dream*).\n- **Gift Finder Rail (\"Who are you buying for?\")**:\n  - Visual cards with circular cutouts: *For babies*, *For kids*, *For the family*, *For adults*.\n\n### 2.8 Trustpilot Reviews & UGC Photo Reviews Breakdown\n- **Trustpilot Main Widget**: Iframe template `5763bccae0a06d08e809ecbb` (`styleWidth=100%&styleHeight=700px`).\n- **Rating Score**: **4.7 out of 5** based on **1,051 verified reviews**.\n- **Star Rating Distribution**:\n  - 5-Star: **87%**\n  - 4-Star: **7%**\n  - 3-Star: **2%**\n  - 2-Star: **1%**\n  - 1-Star: **3%**\n- **UGC Photo Reviews Rail**:\n  - Displays a horizontal gallery of real customer photos taken upon unboxing (`Media 1 of 15`).\n  - Served from `https://productreviews-attachments.trustpilot.com/...`.\n  - Clicking opens a high-resolution lightbox modal.\n- **Brand Engagement**: Wonderbly's customer care team publicly replies to reviews within 24-48 hours, reinforcing buyer security.\n\n### 2.9 Sticky Mobile Bottom Bar\n- **Selector**: `#pdp-stickybar.StickyBar.astro-e2pjwumm`.\n- **CSS Rule**:\n  ```css\n  .StickyBar:where(.astro-e2pjwumm) {\n    background-color: var(--color-kraft-paper-60); /* #FDF8F1 */\n    bottom: calc(var(--sticky-bar-padding-top) * -1);\n    left: 0px;\n    padding: 12px 16px;\n    position: sticky;\n    z-index: 10;\n  }\n  @media (min-width: 1040px) {\n    .StickyBar:where(.astro-e2pjwumm) {\n      display: none !important;\n    }\n  }\n  ```\n- **Behavior**: Appears when users on mobile or tablet scroll past the above-the-fold CTA, ensuring the \"Personalize my book\" button is always within thumbs reach.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Personalization Funnel Step-by-Step Teardown\n\n### 3.1 Step 1: Character & Name Configuration (`/create/start`)\n- **URL**: `https://www.wonderbly.com/ae/personalized-products/lost-my-name-v2-book/create/start?locale=en-US`\n- **Layout**: Clean full-page form with back navigation to PDP.\n- **Header**: Step counter: `Step 1 of 1`, Heading: `Who are you making this book for?`.\n- **Form Elements**:\n  1. **First Name Input**:\n     - `<input id=\"name\" name=\"name\" class=\"SingleLineText_input___pEvb\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"\">`.\n     - Error state: `aria-invalid=\"true\"`, red border, helper message: `\"Oops! Don't forget to fill this in\"` (`.Fields_error__jq2nx`).\n  2. **Gender Radio Toggle**:\n     - Cards group: `RadioGroup_cardsGroup__QtuO5`.\n     - Options: `Boy` (`value=\"boy\"`) vs `Girl` (`value=\"girl\"`).\n  3. **Character Phototypes**:\n     - Displays 3 natural hair/skin options per gender:\n       * `type-ii` (Light skin, brown/blonde hair)\n       * `type-iii` (Medium skin, dark brown wavy hair)\n       * `type-vi` (Dark skin, curly black hair)\n     - Phototype images hosted on S3:\n       * `https://muse-mpr-assets.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/canvas_assets/muse-product-lost-my-name/phototype/boy_type-ii.png`\n       * `https://muse-mpr-assets.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/canvas_assets/muse-product-lost-my-name/phototype/boy_type-iii.png`\n       * `https://muse-mpr-assets.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/canvas_assets/muse-product-lost-my-name/phototype/boy_type-vi.png`\n- **Action Buttons**:\n  - Primary Submit: `button.PrimaryButton_primary__hrgvW[type=\"submit\"]` -> `\"Continue\"`.\n  - Secondary Back: `button.TextButton_text__c2RU1` -> `\"Back to the product page\"`.\n\n---\n\n### 3.2 Detailed Avatar Builder Analysis (*Where Are You?*)\nFor books requiring granular avatar building, Wonderbly deploys an interactive 3-tab creation wizard:\n\n```\n[ Tab 1: Name ]  -->  [ Tab 2: Skin tone ]  -->  [ Tab 3: Hair ]\n```\n\n1. **Tab 1: Name**:\n   - Inputs: `What's the child's name?` (First Name) + `Last name` (Surname) + `Boy / Girl` radio cards.\n   - Real-time Avatar Preview renders instantly at the top:\n     `https://mu2.wonderbly.com/product/where-are-you/image/avatar?pose=hero&size=journal&type=child&count=0&character=0&_width=320`\n2. **Tab 2: Skin Tone**:\n   - 9 distinct skin tone swatches (`tone-1` through `tone-9`).\n   - Radio buttons with dynamic swatch graphics:\n     `https://mu2.wonderbly.com/product/where-are-you/image/avatar?pose=swatch&size=journal&select=skintone&skintone=tone-X`\n3. **Tab 3: Hair Configuration**:\n   - **12 Hair Styles** (`hairtype`):\n     * `hair-1` to `hair-12` covering straight, wavy, short, long, curly, fade, buns, afro, and ponytails.\n     * Swatch URL: `https://mu2.wonderbly.com/product/where-are-you/image/avatar?pose=swatch&size=journal&select=hairtype&hairtype=hair-X`\n   - **7 Hair Colors** (`haircolour`):\n     * `haircolour-1` to `haircolour-7` (Black, Dark Brown, Light Brown, Blonde, Red/Ginger, Auburn, Grey).\n     * Swatch URL: `https://mu2.wonderbly.com/product/where-are-you/image/avatar?pose=swatch&size=journal&select=haircolour&haircolour=haircolour-X`\n   - **Dynamic Live Compilation**: The character updates in real-time with full composite query strings:\n     `...&gender=male&hairtype=hair-2&skintone=tone-3&haircolour=haircolour-1`\n\n---\n\n### 3.3 Step 2: Live Preview Reader Engine (`/create/preview`)\n- **URL**: `https://www.wonderbly.com/ae/personalized-products/lost-my-name-v2-book/create/preview`\n- **Page Title**: `Personalize your book for Zayed`\n\n#### Dynamic Page Generation Architecture\nFor test name **ZAYED**, the rendering engine dynamically generates **36 individual book pages (18 full double spreads)**:\n1. **Front Cover**: `preview/front/front-right` + `preview/front/front-left`\n2. **Welcome Spread**: `preview/welcome/welcome` (personalized with Zayed and chosen phototype)\n3. **Dedication Spread**: `preview/dedication/dedication-left` + `preview/dedication/dedication-right`\n4. **Introduction Story**: 2 spreads (`intro-first-left/right`, `intro-second-left/right`)\n5. **Letter 'Z' Story (Zebra)**: 2 double spreads (4 pages)\n6. **Letter 'A' Story (Aardvark)**: 2 double spreads (4 pages)\n7. **Letter 'Y' Story (Yeti)**: 2 double spreads (4 pages)\n8. **Letter 'E' Story (Elephant)**: 2 double spreads (4 pages)\n9. **Letter 'D' Story (Dragon)**: 2 double spreads (4 pages)\n10. **Outro Climax**: 2 spreads revealing the full reconstructed name\n11. **Marketing & Back Cover**: `marketing/marketing` + `back/back-left/right`\n\n#### Viewer Controls & Layout Toggle\n- **Layout Switcher**: `.LayoutSelector_layoutButton__qr7Vj`\n  - `One-page view`: Single vertical scrolling column.\n  - `Two-page view`: Side-by-side spread view mimicking a physical opened book.\n- **Physical Book Shading Effects**:\n  - Gutter spine shadow: Multi-stop linear gradients simulating book curvature.\n  - Book drop shadow: 3-layer box shadow with warm gold undertones (`rgba(129, 92, 24, 0.12)`).\n\n---\n\n### 3.4 In-Reader Customization Drawers & Micro-Upsells\nWonderbly displays 5 customizable drawer buttons docked on the interface:\n\n1. **Cover Color Selection**:\n   - Heading: *\"Which color would they love? For the finishing touch, choose from four delightful covers\"*\n   - Options:\n     * `cover-i` (Green): **FREE**\n     * `cover-ii` (Blue): **+$3.00 USD**\n     * `cover-iii` (Yellow): **+$3.00 USD**\n     * `cover-iv` (Red): **+$3.00 USD**\n     *(On Where Are You, Artist's Editions upsell at **+$6.00 USD**)*.\n2. **Created By (Gifter Name)**:\n   - Heading: *\"Who made this book? Add your name and we’ll give it pride of place.\"*\n   - Input: `<input id=\"gifter_name\" name=\"gifter_name\" type=\"text\">`.\n   - Examples: `Uncle Altamash`, `Mom and Dad`.\n3. **Dedication Editor**:\n   - Heading: *\"Write your own message for [Name]\"*\n   - Subtitle: *\"Include your own dedication on the first page. There's a 10 line limit (including blank lines) so make sure to preview your message before it goes to print.\"*\n   - Pre-filled message:\n     `\"Dear Zayed,\n\nWe meet a lot of magical and wonderful creatures throughout our lives.\nThese are just the first. We hope you meet a whole lot more.\"`\n   - Constraints: **400 characters max limit** with live countdown indicator (`MultiLineText_charactersLeft__JOrw_`), **10 lines maximum**.\n4. **Photo Upload Micro-Upsell Modal**:\n   - Heading: *\"Add a snap that sparks happy memories\"*\n   - Subtitle: *\"Personalize your book with a meaningful photo\"*\n   - Pricing: **+$4.99 USD** upsell badge (`Upsell_upsell__DTkUi`).\n   - File input: `accept=\"image/*,.png,.gif,.jpeg,.jpg,.heic\"` with drag-and-drop label.\n5. **Book Language Switcher**:\n   - Allows switching story text between 10 supported languages on the fly.\n\n---\n\n### 3.5 Step 3: Format Selection & Price Anchoring (`/create/formats`)\n- **URL**: `https://www.wonderbly.com/ae/personalized-products/lost-my-name-v2-book/create/formats`\n- **Heading**: `Choose a format for your book`\n- **Subheading**: `Make your gift even more glorious with our selection of cover options`\n\n#### The 3-Tier Price Anchoring Ladder\n\n| Format | Badge | Price (USD) | Description | Pre-selected? |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Layflat** | `Lifetime keepsake` | **$59.99 USD** | *Luxurious pages that lay perfectly flat when reading – all wrapped up in a sturdy cover for an unforgettable gift.* | No |\n| **Hardcover** | `Most popular` | **$39.99 USD** | *A premium hardcover with a quality matte finish. Made to be read again and again.* | **YES (Default)** |\n| **Softcover** | None | **$24.99 USD** | *A lovely, lightweight softcover printed on thick, durable paper.* | No |\n\n*Note on Upselling Psychology*: Wonderbly lists the book as **\"From $24.99 USD\"** on the PDP, but when users reach the formats screen, the **$39.99 Hardcover is automatically checked by default**, increasing Average Order Value (AOV) by +60% without user friction. On *Where Are You?*, the Jumbo Hardcover is pre-selected at **$74.99 USD** (nearly double the $39.99 entry price).\n\n---\n\n### 3.6 Step 4: Gift Box & Wrap Upsells (`/create/giftwraps`)\n- **URL**: `https://www.wonderbly.com/ae/personalized-products/lost-my-name-v2-book/create/giftwraps`\n- **Heading**: `Add a final flourish`\n- **Subheading**: `Choose from our collection of recyclable gift boxes and wraps`\n\n#### Upsell Tiers\n\n| Gift Option | Price Bump | Visual Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Deluxe Giftbox** | **+$14.99 USD** | *Lift up your gift to luxurious levels in this presentation-style box with gold foil detailing.* |\n| **Premium Giftbox** | **+$7.99 USD** | *A wonderfully weighty gift box adorned with brightly-coloured Wonderbly crowns.* |\n| **Giftwrap** | **+$5.99 USD** | *An envelope-style wrap for a sleek and colorful finish.* |\n| **No giftwrap option** | $0.00 | Radio option to decline. |\n\n- **Live Sticky Bottom Bar**: Shows real-time running subtotal (e.g. `Subtotal: $39.99 USD`) and updates instantly when selecting gift boxes.\n\n---\n\n### 3.7 Step 5: Post-Add Interstitial (`/continue-shopping/kids`) & Cart (`/cart`)\n\n#### Post-Add to Cart Interstitial Page\nWhen the user finishes the creation funnel, Wonderbly routes them to an intermediate upsell page:\n- **URL**: `/ae/continue-shopping/kids?product-added=lost-my-name-v2`\n- **Success Toast**: `Magic! Your book is added to cart!`\n- **Hook Headline**: `Every child needs another adventure`\n- **Irresistible Offer**: `Don't miss out - get a second book at half price with code BOGO50`\n- **Cross-Sell Grid**: Shows 8 bestselling titles with \"50% off your second book with BOGO50\" badges.\n- **Sticky Footer Bar**: Displays live cumulative cart total and direct link to **\"View cart\"**.\n\n#### Cart Page (`/ae/cart`)\n- **Title**: `Your Cart (X)`\n- **Dynamic Rendered Line Items**:\n  - Displays a realistic 3D thumbnail of the custom book cover with child's exact name.\n  - Sub-actions:\n    * `Edit book` (`/edit/preview/cart/[id]`)\n    * `Edit format and gift wrap` (`/edit/formats/cart/[id]`)\n    * `Edit other extras` (`/edit/add-ons/cart/[id]` — stickers, bookmarks)\n- **Order Summary**:\n  - Subtotal calculation\n  - Coupon Code input accordion (`textbox \"COUPON CODE\"` + `button \"Apply\"`)\n  - Automated BOGO50 discount deduction (-$20.00 USD)\n  - Referral Integration: `Been referred by a friend?` powered by **Mention-Me**.\n  - Express Checkout: Apple Pay, Google Pay, PayPal.\n\n---\n\n### 3.8 Step 6: Checkout (`/checkout`) & UAE Delivery Signals\n- **URL**: `https://www.wonderbly.com/ae/checkout`\n- **Security & Reassurance**:\n  - `Our site is fully encrypted, so your details stay safe`\n  - ⭐ **Crucial Gifting Reassurance**: `\"For your reassurance, no prices or invoices are included in the package\"`\n- **Localization Signals**:\n  - Phone number input automatically sets default prefix to UAE: `+971`.\n  - Delivery: Ships from UK/Europe via international courier. Standard transit: 7-10 working days.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Exact DOM Selectors & CSS Architecture Matrix\n\n| Component / Function | Wonderbly Selector | CSS Module / Framework | Computed Styling Tokens |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **PDP Main CTA** | `button[data-testid=\"pdp-cta\"]`, `button.Button-Button-ae419` | Astro Component | `background: #23231E`, `color: #FFF`, `height: 48px`, `border-radius: 2px` |\n| **PDP Locale Selector** | `select[data-testid=\"pdp-locale-select\"]`, `.Select-root-5ef8e` | Astro Component | `border: 2px solid #BDBDBB`, `padding: 12px`, `font-family: Atak` |\n| **PDP Sticky Bottom Bar** | `#pdp-stickybar.StickyBar` | Astro Component | `position: sticky; bottom: -16px; background: #FDF8F1; z-index: 10;` |\n| **PDP Pricing Label** | `div[data-test-id=\"price-label\"]`, `.Price-price-18ed5` | Astro Component | `font-family: Rza; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 500; color: #23231E;` |\n| **PDP Accordions** | `button[data-gtm-id^=\"qna-accordion-trigger\"]`, `.Accordion-trigger-6873f` | Radix UI / Astro | `font-family: Atak; font-weight: 600; font-size: 20px;` |\n| **Creation First Name** | `input#name.SingleLineText_input___pEvb` | Next.js CSS Modules | `border: 2px solid #BDBDBB; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;` |\n| **Creation Validation Error**| `p.Fields_error__jq2nx` | Next.js CSS Modules | `color: #851926; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 4px;` |\n| **Preview Pages Container** | `ol.Pages_pages__g5_K9` | Next.js CSS Modules | `display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); max-width: 1200px;` |\n| **Preview Page Image** | `img.PageImage_image__HW5Xl` | Next.js CSS Modules | `aspect-ratio: 1.38667 / 1; border-radius: 2px;` |\n| **Preview Spine Shadow** | `.PageImage_page-left__YbgDj::after` | Next.js CSS Modules | `linear-gradient(270deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.1) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 3.5%, transparent 26%)` |\n| **Format Radio Option** | `input[name=\"format_identifier\"].Format_radio__O2FQY` | Next.js CSS Modules | `accent-color: #1E5751; border: 2px solid #BDBDBB;` |\n| **Format Badge** | `div.Format_badge__Odzkr` | Next.js CSS Modules | `background: #1E5751; color: #FFF; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;` |\n| **Giftwrap Option** | `div.Giftwrap_giftwrap__TxsYe` | Next.js CSS Modules | `border: 1px solid #BDBDBB; border-radius: 0px; padding: 16px;` |\n| **Cart Item Card** | `div[data-testid*=\"cart-item\"]`, `.CartItem` | Next.js CSS Modules | `display: flex; gap: 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #E9E9E9;` |\n\n---\n\n## 5. The \"10X Playbook\" for PersonalizedTales.com\n\n### Where Wonderbly Excels\n1. **Frictionless Funnel Progression**: They do not overload the customer up-front. They ask for Name + Character Look -> immediately generate the book -> allow customer to fall in love with the 36-page preview -> monetize with add-ons only after emotional investment is locked.\n2. **Dynamic Preview Quality**: Full 36-page reader with realistic spine shading and curvature shadows.\n3. **Aggressive Pricing Ladders**: Pre-selecting Hardcover ($39.99 / $74.99) and offering Cover Color upgrades ($3-$6), Photo Dedications ($4.99), and Gift Boxes ($7.99-$14.99).\n4. **Post-Add Interstitial**: The `/continue-shopping/kids?product-added=...` page with `BOGO50` offer is a masterclass in driving multi-book order rates.\n\n---\n\n### Wonderbly's Critical Weaknesses in the UAE & GCC Market\n1. ❌ **Zero Native Arabic Language Support**: Wonderbly offers 10 European languages (English, French, German, Spanish, Italian, Dutch, Portuguese, Danish, Swedish), but **ZERO Arabic support**. No Arabic stories, no Arabic name typography, no Arabic right-to-left (RTL) reader.\n2. ❌ **Foreign Currency (USD Only)**: Customers in Dubai and Abu Dhabi see **USD pricing** and get charged foreign exchange transaction fees on their cards.\n3. ❌ **No Local Payment Methods**: Wonderbly lacks **Tabby, Tamara, and local GCC debit cards (Mada/Benefit/KNET)**.\n4. ❌ **Slow International Shipping**: Books are printed in the UK or Europe and dispatched via international mail (7-10 working days transit).\n5. ❌ **Western-Centric Character Aesthetics**: Avatars do not feature traditional Emirati cultural attire (Kandora, Ghutra, Agal, Jalabiya, Abaya, Hijab).\n\n---\n\n### Technical & UX Roadmap for PersonalizedTales.com to Win the UAE Market\n\n| Feature Area | Wonderbly UAE Benchmark | PersonalizedTales.com 10X Upgrade |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Language & Orientation** | LTR only; 10 European languages; 0 Arabic. | **Full Dual-Language Engine (Arabic & English)**. Native RTL layout switch, curated classical and conversational Emirati Arabic prose. |\n| **Name Rendering** | Basic Western serif font overlay. | **AI-Assisted Arabic Calligraphy Engine**: Child’s name rendered in custom Ruq'ah, Diwani, or modern Naskh calligraphy on cover and spreads. |\n| **Cultural Avatars** | Standard Western apparel (jeans, t-shirts, dresses). | **Authentic GCC Representation**: Optional Kandora, Ghutra, Agal, Jalabiya, Hijab, plus modern casual styles, with 12+ skin and hair variants. |\n| **Currency & Pricing** | USD only ($24.99, $39.99, $59.99). | **Direct AED Pricing**: 99 AED (Softcover), 149 AED (Hardcover), 199 AED (Luxury Layflat Foil). No FX fees. |\n| **Local Payment Methods** | Credit Card, PayPal. | **Stripe UAE, Apple Pay 1-click, Google Pay, Tabby (4 split-payments 0% interest), Tamara**. |\n| **Delivery Speed** | 7-10 working days from UK. | **Local UAE Print-on-Demand Partnership** (Dubai/Sharjah facility): 24-48 hour delivery via Aramex / DHL across all 7 Emirates. Same-day gift delivery option in Dubai. |\n| **Gift Unboxing Experience** | Recyclable cardboard mailer + $14.99 generic box. | **Premium Scented Arabic Gift Box**: Magnetic closure, gold-foiled Islamic geometric motifs, scented oud/musk paper unboxing, personalized ribbon. |\n| **Interactive Live Preview** | 36-page static server-rendered JPEG spreads. | **Interactive 3D WebGL / Three.js Flipbook**: Smooth page-turning physics, audio sound of real paper turning, and instant real-time AI generation. |\n| **Post-Add Interstitial** | Generic BOGO50 banner. | **\"Sibling & Cousin Pack\" Bundle Upsell**: \"Add a matching adventure for a sibling or cousin for 40% off\" with one-click cloning of the family name. |\n"